My singing voice melts and becomes morning,

137
00:12:48,269 --> 00:12:50,789
悲しみごと抱いて微熱を帯びる
embracing the sadness and taking on a slight fever.

138
00:12:51,069 --> 00:12:55,329
綺麗な世界で生きていった そんなのズルいよな
Living in a beautiful world, isn't that unfair?

139
00:12:55,629 --> 00:12:59,209
偽りを身に纏って 心のままカオティックに
Clad in falsehoods, remaining chaotic in my heart.

140
00:13:11,209 --> 00:13:14,049
ああ、他人事みたいな夜だ
Ah, it's a night that feels like someone else's business.

141
00:13:14,309 --> 00:13:17,229
ばらまいた星だけがキラリ澄んでいる
Only the scattered stars are glittering and clear.

142
00:13:17,449 --> 00:13:20,189
そんなに綺麗にはなれないや
I can't become that pretty.

143
00:13:20,469 --> 00:13:23,129
それでも今夜往くための歌
Even so, this is a song for going forth tonight.

144
00:13:33,709 --> 00:13:36,189
ああ、ほんの小さな夜だ
Ah, it's a truly tiny night.

145
00:13:36,449 --> 00:13:38,629
寝るには早く、夜明けはまだ遠く
Too early to sleep, dawn is still far off,

146
00:13:38,889 --> 00:13:41,089
憧れるには遅く、挫けるにはまだ早い
too late to yearn, still too early to break down.

147
00:13:44,969 --> 00:13:47,409
言葉はいつまでも下手だよ
Words are always clumsy,

148
00:13:47,629 --> 00:13:49,809
ため息だけが上手になるよ
only sighs get better.

149
00:13:50,089 --> 00:13:53,769
傷付く度、違う生き物だと知るよ
Every time I get hurt, I learn I'm a different creature.

150
00:13:54,089 --> 00:13:56,369
それでも一杯歌うよ
Even so, I'll sing with all my heart.

151
00:13:56,629 --> 00:13:58,789
泣きたい夜があったなら
If there was a night you wanted to cry,

152
00:13:59,069 --> 00:14:01,249
笑えない夜があったなら
if there was a night you couldn't smile,

153
00:14:01,529 --> 00:14:04,549
溶けて消えて無くなって きっともう一度ゼロから始めよう
melting, vanishing and disappearing—let's surely start over from zero once more.

154
00:14:05,429 --> 00:14:07,929
明日のことはわからないや
I don't know about tomorrow,

155
00:14:08,169 --> 00:14:10,409
昨日のことも知らないや
I don't know about yesterday either.

156
00:14:10,689 --> 00:14:15,169
明けない夜があったって 私は煌めく星になれなくていい
Even if there's a night that never breaks, I don't need to become a glittering star.

157
00:14:15,629 --> 00:14:20,189
煌めく星になれなくていい
I don't need to become a glittering star.

158
00:15:05,187 --> 00:15:08,137
切なすぎた夜空だった
It was a night sky that was too painful...

159
00:15:09,537 --> 00:15:11,837
儚すぎたでも
It was too fleeting, but...

160
00:15:13,537 --> 00:15:17,537
きっと美しすぎて
surely it was too beautiful...

161
00:15:49,337 --> 00:15:54,237
言葉は いつまでも下手だよ
My words are always so clumsy...

162
00:15:54,937 --> 00:15:59,537
ため息だけが上手になるよ
Only my sighs get better.

163
00:16:00,037 --> 00:16:04,537
傷ついて 違う生き物だとしても
Even if we're hurt and different creatures,

164
00:16:05,037 --> 00:16:10,237
それでも 精一杯歌うよ
still, I'll sing with all my might.

165
00:16:10,637 --> 00:16:14,537
泣きたい夜があったなら
If there is a night you want to cry,

166
00:16:14,837 --> 00:16:21,037
笑えない夜があったなら
if there is a night you cannot smile,

167
00:16:22,037 --> 00:16:26,537
溶けて消えてなくなって
melting, fading away,

168
00:16:27,037 --> 00:16:32,037
きっともう一度ゼロから始めよう
let's surely start over from zero once more.

169
00:16:33,037 --> 00:16:37,537
明日のことは分からないや
I don't know anything about tomorrow,

170
00:16:38,037 --> 00:16:43,037
昨日のことも知らないや
and I don't know anything about yesterday either.

171
00:16:43,537 --> 00:16:48,037
明けない夜があったって
Even if there's a night that won't break into dawn,

172
00:16:48,337 --> 00:16:54,037
私はきらめく星になれなくていい
I don't need to become a twinkling star.

173
00:16:55,037 --> 00:16:59,537
きらめく星になれなくていい
I don't need to become a twinkling star—

174
00:17:00,037 --> 00:17:05,537
そんな今夜 素敵に生きるための歌
a song to live wonderfully tonight.

175
00:17:46,837 --> 00:17:53,037
窓の向こうを ほしたちを
Beyond the window, the stars...

176
00:17:54,037 --> 00:18:01,537
数えてたら 眠ってた
as I counted them, I fell asleep.

177
00:18:02,537 --> 00:18:10,537
その寝息を のいつか混ざる
That breathing... mixing someday

178
00:18:11,037 --> 00:18:16,537
画面の向こう そばにいる
beyond the screen, being right by your side.

179
00:18:17,037 --> 00:18:21,037
言葉なんてない
There are no words,

180
00:18:21,037 --> 00:18:26,537
傷つくこともない
no getting hurt either,

181
00:18:27,037 --> 00:18:35,537
まるでエトランゼ 愛しくで
just like an etranger, so dear...

182
00:18:37,037 --> 00:18:45,037
こんなにそばにいるのに本当は遠い
Even though you're so close, you're actually far away.

183
00:18:45,037 --> 00:18:54,037
伝えてた言葉が 涙になったプレイヤー
The words I tried to convey became tears, player.

184
00:18:54,537 --> 00:18:59,237
今日もがんばったんだね
You worked hard again today, didn't you?

185
00:18:59,537 --> 00:19:07,037
本当は手を差し伸べたい 私の知らない
I actually want to reach out my hand, to things I don't know—

186
00:19:07,537 --> 00:19:14,537
キミのことを どうすればいい
what should I do about you?

187
00:19:21,037 --> 00:19:26,537
どうすればいい なんてもない
What should I do? There's nothing like that,

188
00:19:27,037 --> 00:19:36,037
何かすると 崩れそう
if I do something, it feels like it'll collapse.

189
00:19:38,037 --> 00:19:47,037
ひとりここで 思いをはせ 時間だけが過ぎてゆく
Alone here, pondering as time just passes by.

190
00:19:55,037 --> 00:20:02,537
知らない道 ほしは広がってて
An unknown road, stars spreading out.

191
00:20:03,363 --> 00:20:07,623
君だけ、君だけを待ってる
Waiting only for you, only for you...

192
00:20:23,545 --> 00:20:27,845
蜘蛛の巣を抜けよう
Breaking through the spider's web...

193
00:20:29,545 --> 00:20:33,045
揺ら揺らと
Swaying, swaying...

194
00:20:34,045 --> 00:20:42,045
いい道は 心地いいのにな
Even though a good path feels so nice...

195
00:20:43,045 --> 00:20:46,045
いいのに
Even though it should be...

196
00:20:53,145 --> 00:20:57,845
どんなにそばにいるのに 本当は遠い存在
Even though you're right beside me, you're actually so far away.

197
00:20:57,845 --> 00:21:05,545
逢いたいのにな 会えないな
Even though I want to see you, I can't meet you.

198
00:21:06,245 --> 00:21:08,845
嫉妬したい気持ち
The feeling of wanting to be jealous...

199
00:21:10,145 --> 00:21:18,545
今日も頑張ってんだね どうか君に届くように
You worked hard again today, I hope it reaches you...

200
00:21:19,845 --> 00:21:25,545
ああ 見守ってるずっと遠くから
Ah, I'm watching over you from far away, always...

201
00:21:29,545 --> 00:21:37,045
ああ...
Ah...

202
00:21:53,045 --> 00:22:10,045
ポリラタッタ スパリラダ...
Poriratatta sparilada...

203
00:22:13,045 --> 00:22:19,845
たとえるならそれはドレスのように すっかり装いを替えて
If I were to compare it, like a dress, completely changing attire...

204
00:22:20,045 --> 00:22:29,545
優しい光で輝きだす 夜の街
The night city begins to shine with a gentle light.

205
00:22:31,245 --> 00:22:39,045
逃げないなら 暗闇は行こう 全部宙だと思えば
If you won't run away, let's go into the darkness, thinking of it all as suspended in air...

206
00:22:40,045 --> 00:22:48,045
ずっと近くに見るよで不思議と怖くないよ
Strangely, seeing it so close, I'm not scared.

207
00:22:49,045 --> 00:22:58,045
話すことは本当はいくつもあったけど
There were actually so many things I wanted to talk about, but...

208
00:22:58,545 --> 00:23:10,045
言葉よりも想いがあふれ出して 響け よしんこに
My feelings overflowed more than words, echo into the seismograph...

209
00:23:11,045 --> 00:23:19,545
感じ合ったメロディ 総言葉も常識もいらないでしょ
Melody we felt together, we don't need words or common sense, right?

210
00:23:20,045 --> 00:23:27,045
君と歌えるのなら
If I can sing with you...

211
00:23:45,545 --> 00:23:50,545
見渡せばほら この夜に浮かぶ
If you look around, see, floating in this night...

212
00:23:50,545 --> 00:24:04,045
輝きのひとつひとつが 誰かを照らすという優しさで繋がってる
Each and every sparkle is connected by the kindness of illuminating someone.

213
00:24:21,545 --> 00:24:30,545
この街は 終わらないダンスを踊ってて
This town is dancing an endless dance...

214
00:24:31,045 --> 00:24:39,045
感情が同調してた 重なっていく
Emotions were in sync, piling on top of each other...

215
00:24:39,045 --> 00:24:49,045
響け よしんこに 感じ合ったメロディ
Echo into the seismograph, melody we felt together...

216
00:24:49,545 --> 00:25:02,045
そう 言葉も常識もいらないでしょ 君となら聞かせて その声 今夜
Yes, we don't need words or common sense, right? If it's with you, let me hear that voice tonight...

217
00:25:03,273 --> 00:25:06,793
だけは一緒に…
Only together...

218
00:25:07,093 --> 00:25:11,433
過ごしてのまに びっくりじゃなくても 君と歌えるのなら
Even if it's not a surprise spent together... If I can sing with you

219
00:25:46,853 --> 00:25:51,353
何も見えない 空 呼んで
Calling out to a sky where nothing can be seen,

220
00:25:51,353 --> 00:25:55,653
ひどい顔で蒔き散らせ
scattering them with a terrible face.

221
00:25:55,653 --> 00:26:00,153
浅かな世界で笑って
Laughing in a shallow world,

222
00:26:00,153 --> 00:26:06,553
誰も知らぬボクは
I, whom nobody knows,

223
00:26:14,053 --> 00:26:19,253
必死にしても守れない約束
promises I can't keep no matter how hard I try,

224
00:26:19,253 --> 00:26:22,053
君にわかったんで
you figured it out.

225
00:26:22,353 --> 00:26:28,553
もしもばかりつぶやいてしまう
I end up muttering 'what ifs' all the time.

226
00:26:28,553 --> 00:26:34,053
笑い疲れた 傷ついていたいな
Tired of laughing, I want to stay wounded.

227
00:26:34,053 --> 00:26:40,053
それでも無駄な小さな優しさ止めてないよ
Even so, I haven't stopped my small, useless kindness.

228
00:26:40,053 --> 00:26:47,053
忘れられないように 大人ぶって入った嘘が
The lie I told acting grown-up so I wouldn't forget

229
00:26:47,053 --> 00:26:51,053
動き出して ボクを押した
started moving and pushed me.

230
00:26:51,053 --> 00:26:59,053
涙さえも 許されなくて 眠れない
I can't even be forgiven for my tears, unable to sleep.

231
00:27:02,053 --> 00:27:07,053
要らない心 重くかさばり動けない
My unnecessary heart weighs heavily, unable to move.

232
00:27:07,053 --> 00:27:13,053
深くなる夜 ボクと待ち合わせをした
I arranged to meet myself in the deepening night.

233
00:27:13,053 --> 00:27:19,053
上手に拭えない昨日を押しつけて また見ないふり
Forcing on yesterday I can't wipe away, pretending not to see.

234
00:27:19,053 --> 00:27:27,053
こんなんでごめん 諦めてないから 辛くて 諦めてないから 貫く
Sorry for being like this, but I haven't given up, because it's painful and I haven't given up, I'll push through.

235
00:27:27,053 --> 00:27:33,053
正しさも分からず手を引いて 誰も知らぬボクは
Pulling my hand without knowing right from wrong, I, whom nobody knows,

236
00:27:33,053 --> 00:27:42,053
約束を隠す 特別じゃない ただ普通でよかった
hiding the promise—it wasn't special, just being ordinary was fine.

237
00:27:42,053 --> 00:27:53,053
ほめてあげてたら 長く伸びた前髪も好きになれた
If I had praised myself, I might have grown to like my long bangs too.

238
00:28:20,053 --> 00:28:25,053
笑い疲れた 傷ついていたいな
Tired of laughing, I want to stay wounded.

239
00:28:25,053 --> 00:28:31,053
それでも無駄な小さな優しさ止めてないよ
Even so, I haven't stopped my small, useless kindness.

240
00:28:31,053 --> 00:28:40,053
忘れられないように 大人ぶって入った嘘が苦しい
The lie I told acting grown-up so I wouldn't forget is painful.

241
00:28:40,053 --> 00:28:46,053
夢寝たりだい 楽しそうでもいいな 甘えられたいいな
Wanting to sleep, it's fine even if it looks fun, wanting to be spoiled is fine.

242
00:28:46,053 --> 00:28:52,053
なれない ここはを 日の中から 明日へと並べ
Unused to this, arranging from within the days toward tomorrow.

243
00:28:52,053 --> 00:28:58,053
当たり前じゃない 朝が 動き出して
A morning that isn't taken for granted starts moving

244
00:28:58,053 --> 00:29:11,053
ボクを押した 涙さえも 許されなくて眠れない
and pushed me—I can't even be forgiven for my tears, unable to sleep.

245
00:30:05,780 --> 00:30:09,080
手に入れた紅茶
The black tea I got,

246
00:30:10,080 --> 00:30:14,900
朝の光 おしゃべり代わりに浮かべて揺らす
floating and swaying in place of morning light and conversation.

247
00:30:15,220 --> 00:30:24,280
今日の始まりは ちょっと特別 そんな気持ちになるんだ
Today's beginning feels a little special, making me feel that way.

248
00:30:30,120 --> 00:30:32,900
温めたミルク
Warmed milk,

249
00:30:36,500 --> 00:30:43,000
落とせば カップジュースみたいに広がる
if you drop it, it spreads like cup juice,

250
00:30:43,500 --> 00:30:52,880
ミニチュアの秘密の世界旅行 なんてね 夕暮れ 飲み干して 午後を迎えに行こう
a miniature secret world tour, or so I say—drinking down the twilight, let's go greet the afternoon.

251
00:31:24,561 --> 00:31:35,561
少し読み進めた本 古い花びら潮の代わりに挟んで
A book I read a little further, with an old petal tucked inside instead of salt,

252
00:31:36,161 --> 00:31:45,561
きっと次に開いたら その香りで物語が変わってる
surely the next time I open it, the story will change with that scent.

253
00:31:48,161 --> 00:31:55,561
オレンジが滲む 水面に来ないあの日の雨が
The rain of that day that didn't come to the orange-bleeding water's surface

254
00:31:56,561 --> 00:32:05,561
作ってく自然の位置で じっくり巡ったら新しい季節かな
making a natural position, leisurely going around—is it a new season?

255
00:32:08,161 --> 00:32:14,561
君と迎えに行く
Going to greet you...

256
00:32:28,161 --> 00:32:37,561
どんな街に沈もう 自分の話だから
Whatever town we sink into, because it's my own story,

257
00:32:38,561 --> 00:32:46,561
特別を集めて 大きな束にしたいんだ
I want to gather up special things into a big bundle.

258
00:32:47,561 --> 00:32:55,561
一緒にね お休みの前には ほんとはもう少し先の
Together, before rest, honestly a little further ahead...

259
00:32:56,561 --> 00:33:05,561
幾度ぎのスパイス 一ふり ここを温めて
A spice of how many times, warming this place up,

260
00:33:06,561 --> 00:33:15,561
星空見上げれば どこまでも飛び立つ 無限大の秘密の宇宙旅行
looking up at the starry sky, flying anywhere we want on an infinite secret space trip.

261
00:33:18,561 --> 00:33:25,561
なんてね 夢を見て 朝を迎に行こう
Or so I say—having a dream, let's go greet the morning.

262
00:33:28,561 --> 00:33:37,561
少し読み進めた本 朝を迎に行こう
A book read a little further... let's go greet the morning.

263
00:34:08,161 --> 00:34:17,561
息をしている だから生きている 何度もずっと言葉を尽くしてきたんだ
Breathing, therefore alive, I've devoted words to it again and again.

264
00:34:18,561 --> 00:34:27,561
息をしている 予分に見えている 青が染み出す 私にとっての何か
Breathing, looking extra, the blue bleeding out—something important to me,

265
00:34:28,561 --> 00:34:38,561
ことが独々している ここはいつも変わらずに
throbbing constantly, here always unchanging,

266
00:34:39,561 --> 00:34:49,561
せかし続ける ボタン一つの命
a single life of a continuing button.

267
00:34:50,561 --> 00:35:01,061
最後まで私のこと覚えててくれるの 消えてしまえそうなの わかってよ わかってよ ねぇ
Will you remember me until the very end? It feels like I might disappear, understand me, please understand me.

268
00:35:02,149 --> 00:35:04,199
いつかは卒業をするんでしょう
If we ever graduate from this world,

269
00:35:06,349 --> 00:35:07,849
日常に戻ったら私たちは
Once we return to our everyday lives,

270
00:35:08,979 --> 00:35:11,679
いなくなるの
We'll become free,

271
00:35:11,979 --> 00:35:17,369
命のような夢を見てるよ
Watching a dream like life unfold.

272
00:35:17,369 --> 00:35:18,869
またねバイバイ
See you later, bye-bye.

273
00:40:22,477 --> 00:40:24,577
あっ 光った流れ星
Ah, a shooting star flashed,

274
00:40:24,577 --> 00:40:26,377
願いそびれ もう一回を待った
I missed my wish, so I waited for another chance.

275
00:40:26,377 --> 00:40:28,577
あっ という間に夜が明け
Ah, the night broke in no time,

276
00:40:28,577 --> 00:40:30,277
もういいやこのまんま散歩しよう
It's okay, let's just go for a walk like this.

277
00:40:30,277 --> 00:40:32,377
あっ 横切った野良猫
Ah, a stray cat crossed my path,

278
00:40:32,377 --> 00:40:34,477
色は黒？でも可愛いから優勝
Is it black? But it's cute, so it wins.

279
00:40:34,477 --> 00:40:36,277
パン屋さんが開くのは 7 時
The bakery opens at 7 o'clock,

280
00:40:36,277 --> 00:40:38,177
あと 10 分何しようっかな
What should I do for the next 10 minutes?

281
00:40:54,577 --> 00:40:56,377
遠回りもーしーもーし亀さんよ
Taking a detour, hey there, Mr. Turtle,

282
00:40:56,377 --> 00:40:58,277
今だけは君になりたい
I want to be you just for now.

283
00:40:58,277 --> 00:41:00,277
ぴょんって跳んだうさぎさん
A hopping rabbit—

284
00:41:00,277 --> 00:41:02,177
ひょんなこと雹が降る豹に出会う
By a strange chance, it hails, and I meet a leopard.

285
00:41:02,177 --> 00:41:05,977
理屈だってあってないようなもんでファンタジー浮かべ今日もニヒルに
Reasoning doesn't make sense, floating in fantasy and smiling cynically today too.

286
00:41:05,977 --> 00:41:08,177
そこの街灯すらも意外と
Even the streetlight there, surprisingly,

287
00:41:08,177 --> 00:41:10,577
僕がイヤフォン外したら歌い出す
Would start singing if I took off my earphones.

288
00:41:10,877 --> 00:41:14,377
冬にだけ可視化される声の温度が
Only in winter can I see the warmth of voices—

289
00:41:14,377 --> 00:41:18,177
春や夏や秋はどこへと消えてしまうのか
Where does it disappear in spring, summer, and fall?

290
00:41:18,177 --> 00:41:22,477
きっとそこにある触れる揺らぐ気づいて気づいてって
Surely, it's there, touchable, swaying, notice, notice, it's...

291
00:41:22,477 --> 00:41:25,977
まるで心の中みたい
Just like inside my heart.

292
00:41:26,877 --> 00:41:29,577
冬にだけ可視化される声の温度が
Only in winter can I see the warmth of voices—

293
00:41:29,577 --> 00:41:33,977
春や夏や秋は誰かに届いてるのかな
In spring, summer, and fall, is it reaching someone else?

294
00:41:33,977 --> 00:41:37,177
だってここにない消える消える
Because it's not here, it disappears, vanishes.

295
00:41:37,177 --> 00:41:42,277
暑さも寒さも全部「ちょうどいい」の前触れ
The heat, the cold, all of it is a prelude to "just right."

296
00:41:42,277 --> 00:41:43,277
「わっ」
"Wow."

297
00:41:43,277 --> 00:41:45,077
瞬間、風が吹いた
A moment, a breeze blew,

298
00:41:45,077 --> 00:41:49,377
どこかの桶屋が儲かったのだろう
Somewhere, a bucket shop must have made a profit.

299
00:41:49,377 --> 00:41:52,577
彼女が大事に認めた特大級のラブレター
A giant love letter that she cherished

300
00:41:52,577 --> 00:41:55,077
空を舞って、伝って、僕が拾う
Floats, travels, and I pick it up.

301
00:41:55,077 --> 00:41:58,577
そんな運命待ちを途中下車
Waiting for such a destined meeting, I get off midway,

302
00:41:58,577 --> 00:42:01,277
僕は僕の呼吸を重ねる
I stack my breaths.

303
00:42:13,877 --> 00:42:15,877
長い長い旅
A long, long journey,

304
00:42:15,877 --> 00:42:18,077
ゆっくりと進んでこう
Let's proceed slowly.

305
00:42:18,077 --> 00:42:22,177
何でも解決してくれる「時間」ってやつが相棒だから
Because "time," which solves everything, is my companion.

306
00:42:22,177 --> 00:42:24,077
息を吸って
Take a breath,

307
00:42:24,077 --> 00:42:26,077
長い長い旅
A long, long journey.

308
00:42:26,077 --> 00:42:30,077
おなかへったそろそろ…
I'm hungry, soon...

309
00:42:38,577 --> 00:42:41,177
焼きたてのパンの香りに思わず
The scent of freshly baked bread

310
00:42:41,177 --> 00:42:42,877
亀もうさぎに乗る
Even a turtle would ride a rabbit.

311
00:42:42,877 --> 00:42:45,177
街灯も瞬いて眠った
The streetlights twinkled and fell asleep,

312
00:42:45,177 --> 00:42:47,077
入れ替わり目を覚ました
Waking up in turns.

313
00:42:47,077 --> 00:42:49,577
鳥たちもしもしか思召し
Birds, hello, what do you wish for?

314
00:42:49,577 --> 00:42:53,577
どきどきはきせきぼうし召し
Excitement is a miracle, put on a hat.

315
00:42:53,577 --> 00:42:57,077
はじまりはじまりおーしかし
It's the beginning, the beginning, oh really,

316
00:42:57,077 --> 00:43:01,077
はじまりはじまりおーしかし
It's the beginning, the beginning, oh really.

317
00:43:01,077 --> 00:43:02,877
「おいしそう」
"Looks delicious."

318
00:43:15,877 --> 00:43:20,277
愛が言葉を見失ってる
Love has lost its words,

319
00:43:20,277 --> 00:43:26,077
空が涙を降らせていたんだ
The sky was letting fall its tears.

320
00:43:26,077 --> 00:43:28,577
誰のために
For whose sake?

321
00:43:28,577 --> 00:43:35,177
なんのために これが運命だと言うの
For what reason do you call this fate?

322
00:43:35,177 --> 00:43:41,077
嘘が街を包み込んで
Lies envelop the town,

323
00:43:41,077 --> 00:43:46,577
鳥かご別に見声を上げていた
A birdcage raised its voice in separation.

324
00:43:46,577 --> 00:43:56,177
たった一つの存在を保つ この場所で君を待ってる
In this place maintaining its single existence, I am waiting for you.

325
00:43:56,877 --> 00:44:01,577
世界はとても苦しそうでした 私に何ができるというの
The world looked so painful; what could I possibly do?

326
00:44:01,577 --> 00:44:07,177
歌うことが正しいかなんて 今も答えは見つからないけど
I still haven't found the answer to whether singing is right,

327
00:44:07,177 --> 00:44:11,577
大丈夫みんながいる 私はここにいるの
But it's okay, everyone is here, and I am right here.

328
00:44:11,577 --> 00:44:19,277
長い何十回があって君と出会うから
Through dozens of long moments, I get to meet you,

329
00:44:19,277 --> 00:44:24,577
夜が明けていく光が降り注ぎ
So night breaks and light pours down.

330
00:44:24,577 --> 00:44:34,077
喜び悲しみを考え前を向く 君と生きてここでこの場所で それが私の世界が
Thinking of joy and sorrow, looking forward, living with you here in this place—that is my world!

331
00:44:34,077 --> 00:44:39,077
その一秒一瞬が煌めく
Every single second sparkles brightly.

332
00:44:39,077 --> 00:44:46,077
過去が虹を壊したとしても
Even if the past shattered the rainbow,

333
00:44:46,077 --> 00:44:53,077
夢が街を暗くして
Dreams darkened the town,

334
00:44:53,077 --> 00:45:02,077
夢が街を暗くしても
Even if dreams darkened the town...

335
00:45:02,219 --> 00:45:03,299
僕の中の僕に聞いた
I asked the me within myself,

336
00:45:03,299 --> 00:45:04,189
どうしたいの?
"What do I want to do?"

337
00:45:07,185 --> 00:45:09,235
そばにいるよ
I'll be right by your side,

338
00:45:09,435 --> 00:45:13,185
君に笑ってほしいんだ
I want to see you smile.

339
00:45:14,385 --> 00:45:18,485
生まれた意味を探しているの
I'm searching for the reason I was born.

340
00:45:19,385 --> 00:45:24,335
転んでもただ走り続けていく
Even if I stumble, I'll just keep running on.

341
00:45:24,835 --> 00:45:27,285
今を生きて明日を投げた
Living in the present and casting away tomorrow,

342
00:45:27,285 --> 00:45:29,885
心が叫びたがってる
my heart is crying out!

343
00:45:34,935 --> 00:45:39,935
タイムマシンに乗ってさ 別の未来を選ぶことができたなら
If I could ride a time machine and choose a different future,

344
00:45:40,185 --> 00:45:45,285
君のいない世界を想像する そんな世界は想像できない
imagining a world without you is impossible.

345
00:45:45,785 --> 00:45:46,935
届いてるよね
You can hear me, right?

346
00:45:46,935 --> 00:45:54,585
この描くこの歌が 何千何万回だってあって 君を選ぶから
No matter how many thousands of times I sing this song, I will choose you!

347
00:45:57,285 --> 00:46:01,935
夜が滲んでいく 水平線の彼方へ
As the night bleeds into the horizon far away,

348
00:46:02,585 --> 00:46:08,285
響く鼓動のことを 確かに感じた
I could truly feel the beating of my heart.

349
00:46:08,835 --> 00:46:12,935
始めよう君との未来を 繋いだ手を離さないで
Let's start our future together, and never let go of our linked hands.

350
00:46:17,585 --> 00:46:20,285
大きな声で名前を呼んで
Call my name out in a loud voice!

351
00:46:23,935 --> 00:46:27,435
奇跡を駆け抜けて
Sprinting through miracles,

352
00:46:28,785 --> 00:46:31,885
どこまでもいけるよ
we can go anywhere!

353
00:46:36,935 --> 00:46:44,385
ここからもう一度 君と私で始めよう 無限の中に生まれた物語を
From here, once more, you and I will start the story born within infinity.

354
00:46:45,285 --> 00:46:52,085
君とどこまでも この世界が悲しみに溢れたとしても 私は歌を歌い続けていく
With you, even if this world overflows with sorrow, I will keep on singing.

355
00:46:56,935 --> 00:46:59,185
君と生きる
Living with you,

356
00:46:59,185 --> 00:47:04,585
ここでこの場所で それが私の世界だ
right here in this place—that is my world!

357
00:47:06,585 --> 00:47:10,585
その一瞬が煌めく
That single moment shines so brightly!

358
00:47:15,585 --> 00:47:22,585
傷ついた涙を流す君が 幸せだと思える世界になりますように 願いを込め歌う
May the world become one where you can feel happy—I sing this with my wish.

359
00:47:50,935 --> 00:47:57,585
私最強で最弱な私 弱気な心をスーツで隠して
I am the strongest yet weakest me, hiding my timid heart behind a suit,

360
00:47:58,285 --> 00:48:04,585
世界はいつも負けない 強気でしたいさせてよ
the world is never defeated, so let me act strong!

361
00:48:22,285 --> 00:48:27,585
今日も一日スマートにライト 人をすり抜け走るステーション
Today too, speeding smoothly past people at the station,

362
00:48:28,285 --> 00:48:31,885
楽しく処理してステージから ビルの見下して拍手してるだけ
handling things happily, looking down at the buildings from the stage.

363
00:48:38,285 --> 00:48:41,585
みんなが思っているような 私を演じたのはいつから
Ever since when did I play the role everyone expected me to be?

364
00:48:44,585 --> 00:48:49,585
わかんなくなってぐちゃぐちゃになっても 信じていたい
Even if I lose track and everything becomes a mess, I want to keep believing.

365
00:48:50,285 --> 00:48:57,585
私最強で最弱な私 弱気な心をスーツで隠して
I am the strongest yet weakest me, hiding my timid heart behind a suit,

366
00:49:04,285 --> 00:49:11,585
鏡に映る私をじっと見つめる 最強サイジャックガード
Staring intently at myself in the mirror, the ultimate psych-jack guard.

367
00:49:26,935 --> 00:49:33,585
毎晩飛び出るノマドりもどん底な 今日昨日辛くても 明日はきっと笑ってる
Every night leaping nomad life, even if yesterday was painful, tomorrow will smile!

368
00:49:34,935 --> 00:49:41,585
信じて信じて 何度裏切られても 何度だって立ち上がれる 私は最高最弱だ
Believe, believe—no matter how many times betrayed, I can stand up. I am the greatest!

369
00:49:42,285 --> 00:49:54,585
みんなが思っているような 私でいたいだけなの わかんなくなってボロボロになっても 立ち続けたい
I just want to be the me everyone expects. Even if I get battered, I want to stand.

370
00:50:09,843 --> 00:50:13,943
私 最強で 最弱なんだ
I'm the strongest yet the weakest.

371
00:50:16,393 --> 00:50:20,993
私 最強で 最弱なんだ
I'm the strongest yet the weakest.

372
00:50:24,093 --> 00:50:27,593
私 最強で 最弱なんだ
I'm the strongest yet the weakest.

373
00:50:28,143 --> 00:50:31,893
壊れ果てなく叫び ひとりひとりだて
Breaking down, my piercing cry rings alone.

374
00:50:32,293 --> 00:50:37,593
愛情は捨てられない 弱きあたしでいさせてよ
I can't discard love, let me be my weak self.

375
00:50:38,493 --> 00:50:41,993
私 最強で 最弱なんだ
I'm the strongest yet the weakest.

376
00:50:41,993 --> 00:50:46,593
弱き心をスーツで隠して
Hiding my weak heart beneath a suit.

377
00:50:46,943 --> 00:50:52,193
最愛 いつも負けない 強いあたしでいさせてよ
My dearest, I always stay undefeated, let me be strong.

378
00:50:53,193 --> 00:51:00,593
壁に映るあたしが じっと見つめ返してくる
The reflection on the wall stares right back at me.

379
00:51:01,293 --> 00:51:05,993
強く愛されたくて悩むの 少し疲れてる
I worry because I want to be loved deeply, I'm a bit tired.

380
00:51:06,293 --> 00:51:07,893
最強 最弱だ
The strongest, the weakest.

381
00:51:19,193 --> 00:51:23,893
最強 最弱だ
The strongest, the weakest.

382
00:51:51,293 --> 00:51:54,593
