Well then, shall we go? Next is from 'Route Effect'!

406
00:55:02,661 --> 00:55:03,921
この曲です
This is the song.

407
00:55:36,991 --> 00:55:46,391
パパ パパピヤ
Pa, pa, pa, piya...

408
00:55:47,706 --> 00:55:51,641
起きた 手に入れた紅茶
Woke up and brewed some tea,

409
00:55:52,266 --> 00:55:59,356
朝の光 お砂糖代わりに浮かべて揺らす
letting the morning light sway like sugar.

410
00:56:00,196 --> 00:56:06,026
今日の始まりは ちょっと特別
Today's beginning feels a little special,

411
00:56:06,641 --> 00:56:10,366
そんな気持ちになるんだ
putting me in just that mood.

412
00:56:11,106 --> 00:56:16,741
温めたミルク
Warming up some milk...

413
00:56:17,476 --> 00:56:25,541
落とせば カップ中に沈むみたいに広がる 道草の秘密
Pouring it in, it sinks into the cup like a secret detour.

414
01:00:03,056 --> 01:00:06,056
冒頭無料はこちらで終了です。
This concludes the free preview portion.

